| elastic net | 0.950 | 0.870 | +0.080 | 10/0/15 | 0.97 | 0.341 | 0.005 |
| linear SVM | 0.950 | 0.963 | -0.013 | 1/3/21 | -0.43 | 0.670 | 0.197 |

